{'symbol': 'ALB', 'date': '2022-11-15 06:45:00', 'title': 'ALBEMARLE ANNOUNCES NEW EXTERNAL AFFAIRS LEADERSHIP', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , NOV. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALBEMARLE CORPORATION \xa0(NYSE: ALB), A LEADER IN THE GLOBAL SPECIALTY CHEMICALS INDUSTRY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT SEAN O'HOLLAREN JOINED ALBEMARLE AS CHIEF EXTERNAL AFFAIRS OFFICER, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER15, 2022."}